Input: {"question": "What is the genre of the film \"The Squeeze\"?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d00", "start": 0, "end": 168, "text": "The Squeeze (1977 film) The Squeeze is a 1977 British gangster thriller, directed by Michael Apted, based on a novel by Bill James (under the pseudonym, \"David Craig\")."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d00", "start": 169, "end": 229, "text": "The screenplay was written by Minder creator Leon Griffiths."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d00", "start": 230, "end": 356, "text": "The production headlines a major cast made up of American actor Stacy Keach, and British actors Edward Fox and David Hemmings."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d00", "start": 357, "end": 442, "text": "Irish actor Stephen Boyd was also featured in a major (and final) role as a gangster."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d00", "start": 443, "end": 588, "text": "To create realism in the film, the producers of \"The Squeeze\" enlisted an ex-gangster called Bob Ramsey to act as a contact between the film unit"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d01", "start": 0, "end": 135, "text": "The Squeeze ( 1977 film ) - Wikipedia Home Random Nearby Log in Settings Donate Now If Wikipedia is useful to you , please give today ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d01", "start": 136, "end": 267, "text": "About Wikipedia Disclaimers Search The Squeeze ( 1977 film ) Article Talk Language Watch Edit This article is about the 1977 film ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d01", "start": 268, "end": 322, "text": "For other films , see The Squeeze ( disambiguation ) ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0115-bbc18abb3233:d01", "start": 323, "end": 470, "t